---
import MovieFlexLegalLayout from "../layouts/MovieFlexLegalLayout.astro";
---

<MovieFlexLegalLayout
  title="Data sources and provider settings"
  description="Official information for MovieFlex's catalogue and streaming availability sources."
  eyebrow="DATA SOURCES"
>
  <h2>Movie catalogue — TMDB</h2>
  <p>
    MovieFlex uses TMDB for movie metadata, search results, ratings, genres,
    details, and poster images. The API Read Access Token is configured by the
    site operator on the server; it should never be entered into a public field
    or shared in the browser.
  </p>
  <div class="link-grid">
    <a
      class="link-card"
      href="https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <strong>TMDB API settings ↗</strong>
      <span>Manage your API credentials in your TMDB account.</span>
    </a>
    <a
      class="link-card"
      href="https://developer.themoviedb.org/docs/authentication-application"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <strong>TMDB authentication docs ↗</strong>
      <span>Read the official Bearer-token setup guide.</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <h2>Streaming availability — JustWatch</h2>
  <p>
    Provider listings are delivered through TMDB's watch-provider endpoints,
    with availability data powered by JustWatch. The information indicates
    reported services for a selected country; it does not guarantee a title is
    still available or show the final price for every plan.
  </p>
  <div class="link-grid">
    <a
      class="link-card"
      href="https://www.justwatch.com/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <strong>JustWatch ↗</strong>
      <span>Check supported titles and services on the official website.</span>
    </a>
    <a
      class="link-card"
      href="https://developer.themoviedb.org/reference/movie-watch-providers"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <strong>TMDB movie-provider API ↗</strong>
      <span>Review the endpoint used for movie availability data.</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <h2>Region preferences</h2>
  <p>
    Choose a country in a movie's details panel to check the providers reported
    for that region. This changes MovieFlex's query only; it does not alter your
    TMDB or JustWatch account settings.
  </p>
  <h2>Required attribution</h2>
  <div class="legal-note">
    This product uses TMDB and the TMDB APIs but is not endorsed, certified, or
    otherwise approved by TMDB. Streaming availability data is powered by
    JustWatch.
  </div>
  <p>
    Review <a href="/copyright">Copyright and attribution</a>,{" "}
    <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>, and <a href="/terms">Terms of use</a>.
  </p>
</MovieFlexLegalLayout>
